full crawl against live PropertyFinder persisted 2,871 listings with ScraperLog
status `success` and no error, where the same code previously saved 0; listing
count 6,294 -> 7,553. All 10 suites green (307 checks).

Also records, at the rate-limiter call site, why its key stays the minted guest id:
measured through the edge, every visitor arrives as ::ffff:127.0.0.1 with no
